+    // Handle resolution change event. With pictures of the old sequence still
+    // in flight the stateful API requires the client to keep queueing CAPTURE
+    // buffers until one comes back marked LAST before stopping the queue.
+    // Stopping it early (as upstream does) leaves Qualcomm's iris firmware in
